 ('ENT_DEMX_GRESIL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Demon of impurity/uncleanness in Michaelis'' Admirable History (1612), of the second hierarchy (Thrones), opposed by St. Bernard. Attested essentially only in Michaelis.'),
 ('ENT_DEMX_SONNEILLON','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Demon of hatred in Michaelis'' Admirable History (1612), of the second hierarchy, whose opposing saint is St. Stephen. Attested essentially only in Michaelis.'),
 ('ENT_DEMX_CARREAU','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Demon of mercilessness/hardness of heart in Michaelis'' Admirable History (1612), of the first hierarchy (Powers), opposed by St. Vincent. Attested essentially only in Michaelis.'),
 ('ENT_DEMX_CARNIVEAN','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Demon of obscenity/shamelessness in Michaelis'' Admirable History (1612), of the first hierarchy (Powers), opposed by St. John the Evangelist. Attested essentially only in Michaelis.'),
